"licence_pathway": "unconditional",
"finding": "established_restriction",
"conclusion": "Guideline AFTD2022-BLK-COM-005 states a person is not fit to hold an unconditional licence if they have experienced blackouts that cannot be diagnosed as syncope, seizure or another condition. The verified fact blackout.mechanism_status = 'undetermined_after_investigation' indicates the cause has not been diagnosed."
},
{
"module": "blackout",
"passage_id": "PASS-c2389eae9eca5bb96ceb386b",
"fact_fields": ["blackout.years_since_last_event"],
"licence_pathway": "conditional",
"finding": "not_established",
"conclusion": "While the patient reports 10 years since the last event, the guideline requires that a conditional licence be considered only if there have been no further blackouts for at least 10 years AND the specialist information confirms the criterion is met. The undetermined nature of the mechanism prevents establishing that the conditional standard is fully satisfied."
}
